<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Javelin</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Rizzle Kicks</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Javelin</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1vlnBRlM6A4e270nzNQklS</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.972" end="00:17.267">We javelin our troubles through the air</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.267" end="00:21.620">We don't need to worry 'bout a thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.620" end="00:25.917">Poppin' bottles, then we're cloud jumpin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.917" end="00:31.429">We don't need to worry 'bout the dos and don'ts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.429" end="00:35.629">We're javelin's in the air</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.629" end="00:40.041">It doesn't matter who you love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.041" end="00:42.276">We're javelin's in the air (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.276" end="00:45.157">Travelling 'til it takes us there (Check)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.157" end="00:46.657" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.374" end="00:47.128">Ayo I been there, I done that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.128" end="00:49.425">With the power of a million, in one man</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.425" end="00:51.480">And now I'm feeling like a damn god, a god damn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.480" end="00:53.683">I ain't tryna be a mad man, Jon Hamm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.683" end="00:55.848">Real talk yeah I been there, and seen that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.848" end="00:57.990">I just wanna get my cake up, and еat that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.990" end="01:00.117">But it's not even about that, it's deep fam</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.117" end="01:02.401">If you seen what I made bruv, with thеse hands</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.401" end="01:04.558">Yeah it's time for the come back, yeah they want that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.558" end="01:06.676">Everybody missing fun rap but they're on tap</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.676" end="01:08.909">Come along for your sun tan and the clack clack</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.909" end="01:11.075">You can even bring your gun hands brudda brap brap</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.075" end="01:13.276">It's space bound party then we zoom off</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.276" end="01:15.428">Said they're gonna bring an army, yeah and do what?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.428" end="01:17.594">We even tryna be here, but we're too gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.594" end="01:20.509">Wanna know when we get there never too long (Too long)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.509" end="01:22.009" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.663" end="01:26.956">We javelin our troubles through the air</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.956" end="01:31.285">We don't need to worry 'bout a thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.285" end="01:35.603">Poppin' bottles, then we're cloud jumpin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.603" end="01:41.189">We don't need to worry 'bout the dos and don'ts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.189" end="01:45.412">We're javelin's in the air</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.412" end="01:49.813">It doesn't matter who you love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.813" end="01:52.170">We're javelin's in the air</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.170" end="01:54.694">Travelling 'til it takes us there</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.694" end="01:56.194" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.898" end="01:56.398">Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.519" end="01:57.791">Ooh, don't you doubt my</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.791" end="01:59.813">Airborne groove man I prove how how high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.813" end="02:01.930">It's true, views from cloud nine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.930" end="02:04.014">Paid my dues, lump sum outright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.014" end="02:06.226">Got proof, got the t-shirt too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.226" end="02:08.242">Live on the air, lifetime on the move</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.242" end="02:09.742">Gonna break right through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.609" end="02:11.109">No me no you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.588" end="02:13.285">On the one love vibe, so pure so true then</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.285" end="02:15.822">Life has it's way with us, plays with us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.822" end="02:17.640">So we all crave a rush, rave it up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.640" end="02:19.751">Yeah got a taste for lust but still</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.751" end="02:21.298">Nothing ain't free, gotta pay for love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.298" end="02:23.463">Tsunami surfer the waves are high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.463" end="02:25.600">Any dream is winner if you aim it right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.600" end="02:27.763">Can't rush a download gotta take your time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.763" end="02:30.302">You can't AirDrop us, we're too fly too right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.302" end="02:31.802" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.470" end="02:36.820">We javelin our troubles through the air</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.820" end="02:41.115">We don't need to worry 'bout a thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.115" end="02:45.494">Poppin' bottles, then we're cloud jumpin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.494" end="02:51.031">We don't need to worry 'bout the dos and don'ts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.031" end="02:55.194">We're javelin's in the air</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.194" end="02:59.609">It doesn't matter who you love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.609" end="03:01.828">We're javelin's in the air</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.828" end="03:05.828">Travelling 'til it takes us there</p></div></body></tt>